#14500
The Great Tower of Xerxes - Level 4~
This area (14501-14638) forms the 4th level of the Great Tower of Xerxes.

The connection points are as follows:

Down of 14501 connected to 14427.
Up of 14626 connected to 14701.
Both the previous connections extend both ways, the following are one-way
connections:
North of 14541 connected to 14353.
East of 14582 connected to 14408.
North of 14586 connected to 14130.

Mob Chutes:
        14638 is the Master Chute.
        14627, 14628, 14629, 14630, 14636 and 14637 are the other chutes.

This level is deadly, designed to KILL a group of 40+ characters. It will take
a long time to wear down the hordes of powerfull monsters inhabiting this
place. The purpose of this level is to ensure the final level of the tower is
difficult to reach by even a competent group with many high level members... 

This area was written by Vex.
~
