#14507
A Misty Tunnel~
You are standing in a gloomy tunnel, filled with a fine grey mist. The only
light is provided by the mist itself, an eerie green glow. The rough stone
of the tunnel is slick with slime, making footing treacherous. The mist 
dampens sounds some what, but you can hear things scraping against stone, and
an occassional blood thirsty roar sends a chill up your spine. Peering through
the murk, you can see tunnels leading to the north, south and west from here.
~
