#14541
A Misty Passage~
As soon as you enter the mist-filled passage, you experience a queasy feeling
in the pit of your stomach and a kaleidoscope of images momentarily blinds
you. This is followed by being subjected to buffeting winds, which subside
almost as soon as they begin. Recovering from the sudden disorientation, you
find you are some where else. Your new surroundings are completely dark and 
bitterly cold. Even your enchanted light sources shed but a dim glow here, 
just barely enough to see by. You can feel a cold stone wall to the east, 
south and west.
~
145 77 0 0 0 0 255 0
D0
Darkness engulfs you, pressing closer on all sides.
~
~
0 0 14353
S
#14542
A Large Cavern~
A fine grey mist hangs densely in the air of this cavern. The walls are of
rough stone, covered in slick, green slime. Rocky projections jut from the 
floor, as rough as the stone forming the cavern walls. You note the lack of
truly natural formations, such as stalactites and stalagmites. The rough
stone formations obscure parts of the cavern from view and you advance
cautiously. The cavern extends further to the east and south, while a rough
stone tunnel leads to the west.
~
145 8 0 0 0 0 255 0
D1
Peering through the mist, you see the cavern extends to the east.
~
~
0 0 14543
D2
Peering through the mist, you see the cavern extends to the south.
~
~
0 0 14546
D3
Peering through the mist, you see a rough stone tunnel to the west.
~
~
0 0 14541
