A Large Stone Hall~
You are in a large hall of plain, featureless stone. The hall is devoid of
any decoration, unless you count the torch brackets on the walls. It would
appear to serve no purpose you can fathom. Your mildly disturbed by the lack
of any obvious way to get out of the hall. A large rectangular column lies
to the south, while the hall itself continues to the east, west and north.
