#14625
A Culdesac~
As soon as you enter the culdesac, you experience a queasy feeling in the pit 
of your stomach and a kaleidoscope of images momentarily blinds you. This is 
followed by being subjected to buffeting winds, which subside almost as soon 
as they begin. Recovering from the sudden disorientation, you find you are 
some where else. Your in a dead end of a smooth stone corridor. A torch in 
the southern wall provides light. You can see a T-junction to the north.
~
