#14632
In the tube~
The tube may be unclimbable, but there are ways around that problem. The tube
is quite wide, but none the less, your sure Zilanthor would not of been able
to squeeze up it, hrmm, of course the way he simply devolved from the
surrounding mists implies that perhaps he has more than one form availble
to him. Of course, it's all academic now, you witnessed, indeed, caused
his demise. Peering through the mists floating in the tube, you think it
ends up ahead.
~
